 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"f06975b9-7f01-4d8b-a42a-aef8c3d368d1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A low-level helper: it resolves vertex placements and propagator shapes \
through the FeynArts shape database and returns one ",
 Cell[BoxData[
 "FeynArts`DiagramGraphics"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "46cfaa8a-820c-4b99-87f2-e86afe26b276"],
 " object per insertion."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c644fd1b-f384-43f3-8593-b27ad6af3cc8"],

